jd-vance-says-donald-trumps-dramatic-kharg-island-post-was-meant-as-a-signal-to-iran/articleshow/133658179.cms", "summary": "US Vice President JD Vance stated Donald Trump's social media post conveyed a message to Iran.  American military officials confirmed no strikes occurred on Kharg Island overnight.  An Iranian official dismissed Trump's post as laughable and not credible.  US forces did attack two Iranian launchers on Larak Island recently.  These developments renew security concerns in the Strait of Hormuz.", "published_at": "2026-08-31T16:47:54+00:00", "image_url": "https://static.toiimg.com/thumb/msid-133658370,width-1280,height-720,resizemode-6,overlay-toi_sw,pt-32,y_pad-600/photo.jpg", "source": {"name": "The Times of India", "tier": "international", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 10, "opinion_fact": 25, "factual_rigor": 50, "framing": 15, "confidence": 0.7, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 2.1, "keyword_emphasis_score": 0.0, "omission_score": 40.0, "headline_body_divergence": 33.6, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}, {"article": {"id": "5ee0b14d-a3e0-4dc0-a432-cd31a9a6e7a4", "title": "Trump was sending message to Iran with Kharg Island post, says Vance - Al Arabiya English", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "summary": "Trump was sending message to Iran with Kharg Island post, says VanceAl Arabiya English", "published_at": "2026-08-31T15:50:00+00:00", "image_url": null, "source": {"name": "Al Arabiya English", "tier": "international", "url": "https://english.alarabiya.net"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 10, "opinion_fact": 25, "factual_rigor": 50, "framing": 6, "confidence": 0.7, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 0.0, "keyword_emphasis_score": 0.0, "omission_score": 38.7, "headline_body_divergence": 0.0, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}, {"article": {"id": "7039a91b-b6ff-4ca2-a7d7-a6505e00c820", "title": "Iran dismisses Trump's post of US attack on Kharg Island as 'laughable' - Khaleej Times", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "summary": "Iran dismisses Trump's post of US attack on Kharg Island as 'laughable'Khaleej Times", "published_at": "2026-08-31T12:40:22+00:00", "image_url": null, "source": {"name": "Khaleej Times", "tier": "international", "url": "https://www.khaleejtimes.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 50, "sensationalism": 10, "opinion_fact": 25, "factual_rigor": 50, "framing": 31, "confidence": 0.7, "rationale": {"framing": {"connotation_score": 100.0, "keyword_emphasis_score": 0.0, "omission_score": 38.1, "headline_body_divergence": 0.0, "has_cluster_context": true}}}]}}, {"article": {"id": "7b2151bc-5e51-4e85-8e21-f22e20977dda", "title": "Trump's AI-Generated Military Posts Spark Mockery Amid Ongoing Conflict: Iran Seeks Negotiation", "url": "https://www.news18.com/videos/india/trump-s-ai-generated-military-posts-spark-mockery-amid-ongoing-conflict-iran-seeks-negotiation-10302528.html", "summary": "U.S. President Donald Trump sparked widespread mockery and criticism after sharing artificial intelligence-generated videos on Truth Social depicting a fictional attack on Iran’s vital Kharg Island oil terminal.Iran is still seeking a negotiated solution to its ‌conflict with the U.S., President Masoud Pezeshkian said on Monday, a day after the two countries resumed hostilities for the first time since late July, driving oil prices up more than 3.5%.Pezeshkian's comments also came after U.S. President Donald Trump posted an AI-generated video clip that he said showed Iran's oil hub Kharg Island being destroyed. There was no evidence of any such attack and a U.S. official said on Monday the military had not targeted Kharg Island in overnight strikes. An Iranian official dismissed Trump's post as \"laughable\". n18oc_indian18oc_breaking-newsNews18 Mobile App - https://onelink.to/desc-youtube", "published_at": "2026-08-31T12:48:16+00:00", "image_url": null, "source": {"nam